{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "ab784ce542c4efc45f315971da48adc22f8491015c3be8d00fb82980971f885c", "ja": "ふたりの☆★ランウェイ", "zh": "两人的☆★T台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "336a4cebdb160fab0521ff849861879b3aef5090f269d2d68492826d22f41578", "ja": "劇場公演の打ち上げ中、プロデューサーのも\nとに読者投票の結果が届く。結果は……同率\n3位！　残念がりつつ、次は1位とはりきる\n奈緒と美奈子。誇っていい結果だと、プロデ\nューサーはふたりを労うのだった。", "zh": "剧场公演庆功宴期间，读者投票的结果送到了制作人手中。结果是……并列第3名！奈绪和美奈子虽然有些遗憾，却干劲十足地表示下次要拿到第1名。制作人慰劳着两人，告诉她们这是值得骄傲的成绩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "672e237c8a7e7b8936628c93c1e69e43dd49247e282a0e51018368b33b258719", "ja": "（『e-m-girl』が発売され、ふたりの\nイベント出演とユニットのお披露目が、無事終わった）", "zh": "（《e-m-girl》正式发售，两人的活动演出和组合亮相也顺利结束了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c4990ea5effbc21aa74f826a1daf3bc0ae1636ee9f54b5e53687bee84e02f11b", "ja": "（その影響か、最近は劇場に\n女性のファンが増えたような気がするな……！）", "zh": "（是因为这个影响吗？总觉得最近剧场里的女性粉丝好像变多了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "fc2ef6f57d75149f9499683648b38038cca1f21a9a881c80df678d2d7e5c00f6", "ja": "んーっ！　恵美オススメのドリンクの組み合わせ、\nメッチャおいしい！　なんなん、これ！？", "zh": "嗯——！恵美推荐的饮料搭配，超好喝！这到底是什么啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "0a7bc0c9bcbd15012337d86687ca5cd3f6df0aa7a3d195895f2f058232d67ed5", "ja": "でしょでしょ♪　最初は、みんな何か心配そうな\n顔するんだけど、めっちゃおいしいんだから！", "zh": "对吧对吧♪　一开始大家都会露出有点担心的表情，但真的超级好喝嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c9119aa184f930601663a5ef2df44958a053b2c7d46eadbf941ea37f00663fd4", "ja": "え、そんなにおいしいんだ……\n恵美、アタシも試すから、どうやって作るのか教えて！", "zh": "诶，有那么好吃吗……\n惠美，我也要试试，教教我该怎么做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "094ee86ff3cbad6145eb149acfc3e06f73fd06142cd8fb0d3e2bbbefe62becc0", "ja": "えっと、オレンジジュースにメロンソーダに……？\nそんなにおいしいなら、ウチでも出してみようかな？", "zh": "那个，橙汁、哈密瓜汽水……？\n既然那么好喝，要不要也在我家试着做做看呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e0b4c982a97100abcd44172ed0bace5b3dced4dfb930403c24a3d1de073f2c83", "ja": "おっ……おぉ！！", "zh": "哦……哦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "0107bb328ae38bddab3ab53596d1147661ce9e006f8368d4d82b1101cc70f912", "ja": "ん？　どしたの、{$P$}？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了吗，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "60a7db422892d76cb6bf25c3c549ac23471bd52e13049241ed69198189722144", "ja": "『e-m-girl』の編集部からメールが届いた。\n人気投票の、速報だ！", "zh": "收到《e-m-girl》编辑部发来的邮件了。\n是人气投票的速報！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "31e448d0da8c5f0f8943c586ce3cf2eefcc71558e313ff4c8d6634e9fe9ef949", "ja": "え！！", "zh": "诶！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "31e448d0da8c5f0f8943c586ce3cf2eefcc71558e313ff4c8d6634e9fe9ef949", "ja": "え！！", "zh": "诶！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "99a001c91a016be22a59a3ffa0fc6af61dce17c54e9e8bff3a11d4569c51bbda", "ja": "アカン、まだ心の準備が……ス～、ハ～……よっしゃ！\n{$P$}さん、お願いします！", "zh": "不行，我还没做好心理准备……吸——呼——好，上吧！\n{$P$}先生，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "9b288a8111734b2ae2453f9ef11fca4203da28c89597e8ae2468934d4fa7fd2a", "ja": "うぅ、わ、私もドキドキするけど……\n{$P$}さん、教えてくださいっ！", "zh": "呜呜，我、我也好紧张……\n{$P$}先生，请告诉我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7c14106eab40e1fc57febb2d58f4c5833292742432e7b91d7b36d933593ea999", "ja": "よし、それじゃ行くぞ……ゴホン！\nえー、奈緒と美奈子の順位は……えっ！？", "zh": "好，那就开始吧……咳咳！\n呃，奈绪和美奈子的排名是……诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "c18dcc2dcfea7d261b5b3eb561473a88f15ccca9e30940b3f844ee7e96e517e6", "ja": "もう、{$P$}！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4049881d608378c2d5d95ab2a2238350b0225e1695b0c5ec1a411e2cf728c093", "ja": "焦らさないで、早く教えてよ～！", "zh": "别卖关子了，快点告诉我嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4c76b9026120661b0b8489e53b401422e7024dd4d3f03e88f623ba0d0228aa34", "ja": "すまない。それじゃ、ふたりの順位を発表するな。\n順位は……同率3位だ！", "zh": "抱歉。那么，现在公布你们两人的名次。名次是……并列第3名！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "f02af96afd903ee654b83257a1933121b2850a76bbc53965614dc43d04b486da", "ja": "えっ？／へっ？", "zh": "诶？／欸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "d1f36b7d5c6fe550cdc33f0492bb8f1726a2a554909a56ceb692c494a12642be", "ja": "へっ？", "zh": "欸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "bed7e61d558d9a97730388c11d1ac5155504061e51b427ca528b4348fc08d97b", "ja": "え～～～！？　ふたりとも、すごいじゃんっ！\n『e-m-girl』の上位、すごい難しいんだよ！？", "zh": "诶～～～！？你们两个都好厉害啊！\n『e-m-girl』的高排名可是超级难拿的哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6b65e34278a81d50ea5223335406c50eef79a844a1678a0915f960884a6207ea", "ja": "でもさぁ、3位ってさ……なんか微妙な数字だよね。", "zh": "不过话说回来，3名……总觉得这个数字有点微妙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "f7115913ac984245f8e59271c2cc6aa65bbfaafc3dbbfc1ffa9ef75f46c385b3", "ja": "うわーん！　それは言わん約束や、歩ー！", "zh": "呜哇——！说好了不提这个的，步——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "71fd8b592322cea0167586319add1c42d21bfd3c771ec8f7bea417d285ac1d0f", "ja": "あ、ごめん！　いや、でもスゴイと思うよ3位！\n何しろ、『e-m-girl』だし！", "zh": "啊，抱歉！不过，我觉得已经很厉害了，3名！毕竟可是“e-m-girl”嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "f79ade8661d776464ae6065c71d2d16f2b459f678ff719951d49c3d770ddffe4", "ja": "3位か……。私も奈緒ちゃんも、\nすっごくがんばったと思うんだけどな。", "zh": "第3名啊……我觉得我和奈绪都已经非常努力了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "31f1cb3eed718672a0051299603192f647d2e9af9b96b13a6b976d678fb14f89", "ja": "そうだな。でも初参加だし、立派だと思うよ。\nとりあえず、次回も掲載決定だそうだ！", "zh": "是啊。不过毕竟是第一次参加，已经很了不起了。听说下次也确定会登上榜单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "36efbab9cf49575f1643a3e2a5039ff5026b1f5987d12535abd0f2812b6aca84", "ja": "ホンマですか！？　それならまあ、今回はこのぐらいで\nカンベンして……1位は、次の機会までお預けやな！", "zh": "真、真的吗！？那样的话，这次就先到这里，放过我吧……1名就留到下次机会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "eff3d380b4ebf0bb30cdde9aafcd21d90d422dac549e43e014ed598234890703", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね！　じゃあ次こそは、\n目指せナンバーワンってことで……。", "zh": "呵呵，确实呢！那么下次一定要以第一名为目标……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_07_2001_019min", "source_sha256": "44c50de2074bd3797d5025ef57d76d1982355ca4c5c8efbfc463256d2915f824", "ja": "かんぱーい！（イエーイ！）", "zh": "干杯——！（耶——！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
